NAME          NO_CONSTRAINTS
* Bounds only: no rows, so no nonzeros. max 2x - y with x in [0, 4], y in [1, 3].
* Optimum 7 at x = 4, y = 1.
OBJSENSE
    MAX
ROWS
 N  OBJ
COLUMNS
    X         OBJ       2.0
    Y         OBJ       -1.0
BOUNDS
 UP BND       X         4.0
 LO BND       Y         1.0
 UP BND       Y         3.0
ENDATA
